The '''Wither Cloak Sword''' is an {{Epic}} [[Dungeons|Dungeon]] [[Sword]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dungeon Reward Chests ===
The '''Wither Cloak Sword''' can be obtained from [[Dungeon Reward Chest]]s in [[The Catacombs - Floor VII]].
{{Catacombs Chest Loot Sources}}

