The '''Wither Cloak Sword''', being a sword, can be used as a melee weapon. Its {{AN|Creeper Veil}} ability can be toggled upon right-click: it has a {{Green|10s}} cooldown between activations, which is halved upon manually toggling the ability off.

The {{AN|Creeper Veil}} ability summons {{Green|6}} invisible {{MobSprite|Ghost;Charged Creepers|nolink=yes}}, which last for the duration of the ability. Should the player not have enough {{Stat|Vitality}} to absorb another hit, the veil will automatically toggle off.

