== Tips ==
* The '''Wither Cloak Sword''' works well when paired with the {{Item|Soulflow Supercell}} or its predecessors, as the {{AN|Creeper Veil}} ability forces the player to leave combat, allowing the accessory to increment {{Stat|overflow mana}}.
* The '''Wither Cloak Swords''' ability can be paired with the [[Hurricane Bow]] to kill {{MobSprite|Bal}} much faster.

