== Trivia ==
* The {{AN|Creeper Veil}} ability would previously persist even when the item was removed from the player's inventory. This has since been patched.
* The {{AN|Creeper Veil}} ability previously dealt {{Red|200}} damage to enemies that hit the entities spawned from the ability.
* The '''Wither Cloak Sword''' can bypass damage from the [[The Watcher|Boomer Undead]]'s TNT and {{MobSprite|Kalhuiki Tribe Member}}s' fatal attacks.
* The '''Wither Cloak Sword''' seems to be the scroll used by [[Necron]] within the journal entry [[Journal#The Apprentice - Part 2|The Apprentice - Part 2]].

